<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Tong Yang Cement H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tong Yang Cement H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 1,205  vs 910</p>
<p>    Net					 10.33  vs 7.80</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     11.53  vs 9.67</p>
<p>    Revenue				  399.33  vs 330.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Tong Yang Cement Corp, established in 1957, is South Korea's second largest cement producer. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
